<urn:atm:triage:finding/R6-QA2-ARCH-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "R6-QA2-ARCH-001" ;
  triage:title "Four delta behaviours are recorded only in the sprint doc and the crate docs (docs/sc-jev-host/architecture.md:62, docs/sc-jev-check/archite" ;
  triage:description "Four delta behaviours are recorded only in the sprint doc and the crate docs (docs/sc-jev-host/architecture.md:62, docs/sc-jev-check/architecture.md:20). The repo-level ADR amendments do not state them. (1) The adapter sets the envelope correlation_id to the session id and request_id to the answer id, and logs failed sends at Warn. This is not in the ADR-SAG-0013 r-6 amendment (lines 856-864). (2) FileSessionStore::new deletes expired *.json documents after TTL plus one TTL of grace. This is not in the ADR-SAG-0008 r-6 amendment (lines 254-266). The sprint doc itself calls it a deviation from the is_expired cutoff. (3) ADR-SAG-0031 Wiring (lines 1754-1756) says a flush failure is a data.warnings entry. It does not cover the error path, where the failure is appended once to the error detail. (4) The ADR-SAG-0016 r-6 amendment does not record the envelope request_id and correlation_id mapping either. No ADR is contradicted. The ADR texts are incomplete, so the contract that governs the code is split between the ADRs and the sprint doc." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-a-refine" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "qa" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-11-08T06:41:16Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:A1-R6 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-11-08T06:39:59Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Pattern RULE-ADR-CODE has zero matches in file_filter docs/architecture.md on both branches; pattern correlation cannot evaluate this missing-text finding. Manual check of docs/architecture.md found no correlation_id/request_id mapping, no expired-document grace rule, and no error-path warning text. Requires manual review before dispatch." ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "1" .

